<title>ESTONIA: TALLINNA KAUBAMAJA SEEKS NEW LOGO.</title>
<headline>TALLINNA KAUBAMAJA SEEKS NEW LOGO.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinna Kaubamaja will organise a competition for a new logo and trade mark, the company said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The department store said in a statement that the new logo is necessary because the company is expanding in Estonia and to other countries.</p>
<p>Tallinna Kaubamaja has created a 60,000 kroon prize fund of which 30,000 kroons is for the first prize.</p>
<p>The competition will close on June 30, 1997, and is being organised with the Estonian Designers Association.</p>
<p>--David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
